  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos Public Procurement Reform Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IDF Grant will help lay the basis for public procurement Reform in Lagos State. It will finance activites to Jump start the implementation of the Lagos State Procurement Assessment Report recommendations. These activies includes enactment of Lagos State Procuremt Law, establisment of a Regulatory Agency for procurement, anti corruption capains etc. To assist the government of Lagos State develop its public procurement reform</narrative>
  </description>
